e randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Li is a ten-year-old girl, she recently sees a beautiful doll in the store, it is the toy she dreams of. Her eyes sparkle when she sees this doll, she really wants to have it. On the other hand, her father, Mr. Zhang, is an ordinary worker, his income is limited, just enough to maintain their basic life. Although Mr. Zhang tries every way to satisfy his daughter's wish, he currently cannot afford the cost of this doll. Xiao Li does not know the family's financial situation, she just simply looks forward to having this doll.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Mr. Zhang most likely respond to Xiao Li's desire for the doll?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Tells Xiao Li that there are more important things in life than toys\nB. Buys a similar but cheaper toy as a substitute\nC. Tells Xiao Li that they can hardly afford food at home, he cannot afford this toy at the moment, talk about it later\nD. Promises that he buys it when Xiao Li gets good grades in the future, to comfort Xiao Li's current disappointment","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00359347544815342,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e053d6006945d27fb84f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367571798,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d0796db31c76434c877a95b739159fcf"}